---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';

const termsContent = `
<h2>1. Operating Entity &amp; Acceptance of Terms</h2>
<p>Whispering Pines Resort by Casa De Bello (located at Malla Ramgarh, Bhowali-Ramgarh-Mukteshwar Rd, Mukteshwar, Nainital, Uttarakhand 263137) is operated by <strong>CASADEBELLO PRIVATE LIMITED</strong> (GSTIN: <strong>05AALCC4284C1ZT</strong>; Registered Office: Bhowali Tehsil, Ramgarh Road, Ghorakhal, Nainital, Uttarakhand 263156). By accessing this website or confirming a reservation with us, you agree to these terms and conditions.</p>

<h2>2. Room Tariffs, Meal Plans &amp; GST</h2>
<p>Room tariffs are dynamic and vary by season, occupancy, room category, and meal plan (CP — room with breakfast; MAP — room with breakfast and dinner). All applicable tariffs, inclusions, and Government of India Goods and Services Tax (GST) are disclosed transparently in writing on your booking confirmation or direct quote before any payment is collected. Official GST tax invoices are issued under <strong>CASADEBELLO PRIVATE LIMITED (GSTIN: 05AALCC4284C1ZT)</strong>.</p>

<h2>3. Booking, Cancellation &amp; Refund Policy</h2>
<p>All reservations are subject to availability and written confirmation via our official booking engine or direct reservations desk (<a href="tel:+917505029696">075050 29696</a> / <a href="tel:+919690194954">09690194954</a> / <a href="mailto:booking@whisperingpinesresort.in">booking@whisperingpinesresort.in</a>). Cancellation and refund terms follow standard hospitality practice and depend on season and rate plan; exact cancellation deadlines, refund eligibility, and any applicable retention charges are clearly communicated in writing prior to booking confirmation. Approved refunds are processed back to the original payment source.</p>

<h2>4. Check-In, Check-Out &amp; Guest Identification</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Check-in time:</strong> 13:00 (1:00 PM)</li>
  <li><strong>Check-out time:</strong> 11:00 AM</li>
</ul>
<p>Early check-in or late check-out is subject to room availability and may incur additional charges. As mandated by Government of India regulations, all adult guests must present a valid government-issued photo ID at check-in.</p>

<h2>5. Resort Rules</h2>
<p>Guests are expected to conduct themselves respectfully at all times and comply with property safety, quiet-hours, and pet-policy guidelines to protect fellow guests, staff, and the surrounding mountain environment.</p>

<h2>6. Liability &amp; Force Majeure</h2>
<p>CASADEBELLO PRIVATE LIMITED (Whispering Pines Resort by Casa De Bello) is not liable for delays, cancellations, or disruptions caused by force majeure events or circumstances beyond reasonable control, including extreme mountain weather, landslides, or government travel advisories.</p>

<h2>7. Contact &amp; Grievance Support</h2>
<p>For booking enquiries, billing questions, or cancellation/refund support, contact our Reservations Desk at <a href="tel:+917505029696">+91 75050 29696</a> or <a href="tel:+919690194954">09690194954</a>, or email <a href="mailto:booking@whisperingpinesresort.in">booking@whisperingpinesresort.in</a>.</p>
`;
---

<Layout
  title="Terms & Conditions | Whispering Pines Resort"
  description="Review booking terms, flexible cancellation policies, payment options, and check-in guidelines for Whispering Pines Resort in Malla Ramgarh, Uttarakhand."
>
  <div class="pt-24 pb-20 bg-[#FAF9F6] min-h-screen">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      
      {/* Header */}
      <div class="mb-12 border-b border-[#2C3531]/10 pb-8">
        <h1 class="font-display text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-bold text-[#0E2C21] mb-4">
          Terms & Conditions
        </h1>
        <p class="text-sm text-[#2C3531]/60 font-sans uppercase tracking-wider">
          Last Updated: November 28, 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      {/* Content Body */}
      <div 
        class="prose prose-lg prose-stone max-w-none 
                   prose-headings:font-display prose-headings:text-[#0E2C21] prose-headings:font-bold
                   prose-p:font-sans prose-p:text-[#2C3531]/90 prose-p:leading-relaxed
                   prose-a:text-[#7A6038] prose-a:no-underline hover:prose-a:underline
                   prose-li:text-[#2C3531]/90"
        set:html={termsContent}
      />
      
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
